(text "Power: Pi micro-USB only. J1 socket on UNDERSIDE. No ID EEPROM.\nU1: ADS1115 / address 0x48 / A0. U2: I2S / left channel / 9 dB.\nR1/R2: keypad 5 V output divided to about 2.5 V.\nGPIO23 HIGH enables audio. LOW shuts down U2. Neither speaker output is ground." (at 16 192 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid 7b47dd7f-0f8e-5507-b154-ebf59c1da01b))
)
